# ==========================================
# Database
# FIX: smartreco.db was previously committed on purpose ("cost control"),
# but it contains real bcrypt password hashes for real-looking accounts
# and leftover test-run rows. Shipping real credential hashes in a PUBLIC
# repo is a security issue, so the SQL database is now ignored. Use
# `python tools/create_tables.py` + `python seed_data.py` (or
# `python create_admin.py`) to bootstrap a fresh local DB instead.
#
# NOTE: chroma_db/ (the vector store / embeddings) is INTENTIONALLY still
# committed and NOT ignored — it holds only product embeddings + catalog
# metadata (no user credentials or PII), and re-generating it means paying
# for Mesh embedding calls again. Do NOT add chroma_db/ here.
# ==========================================
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite3

# Dev/debug scripts — not part of the app
check_events.py
test_api.py
test_env.py

requirements.txt.bak
